    <h1>Terms of Service — Marketplace. Managed.</h1>
    <p class="fine">Last updated: October 2026.</p>
    <p>These terms apply when you use Marketplace. Managed.'s managed listing service. By paying the listing fee, you agree to these terms.</p>

    <h2>1. The service</h2>
    <p>For a flat $5.00 listing fee per item, we will: research comparable listings, recommend a price range, write and publish your Marketplace listing, handle all buyer messages, negotiate on your behalf within your stated price floor and availability, and coordinate the pickup.</p>

    <h2>2. The fee</h2>
    <p>The $5.00 fee is non-refundable once we begin the listing work described above, except as stated in section 6. It is charged once per item at the start of the process.</p>

    <h2>3. Your proceeds</h2>
    <p>You keep 100% of the final sale price. We take no commission. You are responsible for the in-person handoff and for collecting payment from the buyer directly, using the payment method you specified.</p>

    <h2>4. Quote validity</h2>
    <p>Your price quote is valid for 7 days from the date we send it. After 7 days, market conditions may have changed and we may revise the recommended range.</p>

    <h2>5. Price reductions</h2>
    <p>If your item has not sold after 7 days listed, we may reduce the list price by up to 10%. We will message you before any reduction. Reductions repeat weekly under the same notice. The price will never go below the floor you set (or the bottom of your quoted band, if you didn't set one) without your explicit approval.</p>

    <h2>6. Your responsibilities</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The item must match the photos and description you provided. If we determine, from your photos or from a buyer's report at pickup, that it is materially different or damaged, we may decline to list it or remove the listing. If we decline to list your item, we will refund the $5.00 fee.</li>
      <li>You must be available during the handoff windows you provided, or give reasonable notice to reschedule.</li>
      <li>You must have the right to sell the item.</li>
      <li>You must be at least 18 years old.</li>
      <li>The item must be allowed under Facebook's <a href="https://www.facebook.com/policies_center/commerce" rel="noopener">Commerce Policies</a>. We cannot list prohibited items (for example weapons, recalled products, or counterfeit goods), and Facebook may remove listings or restrict accounts at its discretion. If we decline to list an item for this reason, we will refund the $5.00 fee.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Our responsibilities and limits</h2>
    <p>We exercise reasonable care in handling your listing and buyer communications. We are not responsible for buyer no-shows, buyer behavior at pickup, or disputes over payment between you and the buyer. Our total liability is limited to the $5.00 listing fee.</p>

    <h2>8. Cancellation</h2>
    <p>You may cancel at any time before the item sells by messaging us. The $5.00 fee is not refunded if you cancel (see section 6 for when we refund it). We will remove the listing promptly.</p>

    <h2>9. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms; the version in effect at the time you pay applies to your listing.</p>

    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:hello@marketplacemanaged.com">hello@marketplacemanaged.com</a>.</p>
